<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-25T17:08:15.249Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:08:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has reinstated the death penalty for terrorism, treason and high crimes, while its army and Russian mercenaries are implicated in new civilian killings, including the discovery of 54 bodies in Tagadayat. In Nigeria, gunmen on motorcycles killed at least 20 people in a village and separate gunmen killed at least 10 people in eastern Nigeria. Suspected bandits killed 37 people in a Taraba border community. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQS3VfUjBmNi1vbGlWeUJlYTZfMDdUZWZkV1hFLXgyZ1JRYUhicFVPRzZHbjI2MC1DNGY1cHpGbF8xSWdvU3Y2Wm9McnZjemlDN0dibDJLcTlVcm5FeTgtcWRNLUw4bm1WX0F2OEV5WENWRTN0MGZtV0VwLXhINWxBbWhfTm93ckkwd3Ita2taeDh1VnRCVHh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ukrinform&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNenpNdWFmMVhLLTU3Z29pRGlHZDM1NVg0SjFDeDUzaE40VElMS3JFQWVfRF9QLTR1R3VueTFrODh0dUgxT0QteFJlNmU5bUJzV05ydmRmbEVpYTRiU3JDbVg4UUY3V1p5Nm9pa1ZZNFA2NWRWN1FnQnA4S09EcG8zS3NMd3hGc2FZS2trSmZpVGpSUkc4S3JwbU9sQXZGNUFuejc1ZUhvdFdGZjJRYUxuZDd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go